WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:05.100
I want to get to know you better.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.000
S-So if it's okay with you...

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.930
<i>Emergency alert. Emergency alert.</i>

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.150
<i>Alert Level C.</i>

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:14.450
Type White.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:15.110
Repeat.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.090
Alert Level C.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:18.120
Type White.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>Twenty-five years ago,</i>

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.450
<i>massive creatures emerged into 
the world without warning.</i>

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Simply by moving, the Dragons 
caused enormous damage.</i>

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.480
<i>Defying all common sense,</i>

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.560
<i>these monsters vanished as 
quickly as they appeared.</i>

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.120
<i>Since then,</i>

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:59.740
<i>people with the same powers as the 
Dragons have come to be born.</i>

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:18.380
<i>They're called Type Dragons, or D.</i>

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:41.060
<b><i>Unlimited Fafnir</i></b>

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.600
<b>White Leviathan</b>

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.560
Type White approaching Midgar!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.130
Time until arrival?

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.270
Displaying now.

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:12.630
<i>Hey, long time, Lieutenant Mononobe.</i>

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:15.540
Major Loki.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:21.300
<i>I would have contacted you sooner,</i>

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:25.050
<i>but Midgar is electronically secure, too.</i>

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.140
I wasn't waiting for you to contact me.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:32.960
<i>I apologize for dragging you 
to that island so violently.</i>

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:35.860
<i>We here at NIFL were in a hurry, as well.</i>

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:39.820
It isn't about the White Leviathan, is it?

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.200
<i>You're making this very easy.</i>

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.780
<i>Have you been told about 
how Ds become Dragons?</i>

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.330
Yes.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.270
<i>Horrifying, isn't it?</i>

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:54.510
<i>I shudder just thinking about 
those monsters proliferating.</i>

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:57.460
<i>We have to stop them, no matter what.</i>

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.730
Yeah, of course.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:02.320
<i>Then you must know that 
there's a more efficient way</i>

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.930
<i>to deal with the Dragons than defeating them.</i>

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.390
<i>We simply need to do away with the 
Ds whose Ryumons have changed color.</i>

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:14.200
<i>The world is afraid of upsetting the Ds,</i>

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.680
<i>and the Ds won't ever abandon each other.</i>

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.380
<i>Therefore, we need someone 
to work in the shadows.</i>

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:22.570
And you're ordering me to do that.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.750
<i>I'm not ordering you.</i>

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.560
<i>I'm asking you.</i>

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:32.000
<i>You need only kill Ds when it comes to that.</i>

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:36.180
Don't say that like it's so simple.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:37.500
<i>It </i>is<i> simple.</i>

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.780
<i>D or not,</i>

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.010
<i>if they're human, you won't lose.</i>

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:49.970
<i>You're the most powerful 
Fafnir in NIFL, after all.</i>

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.930
<i>If we can't have your cooperation,</i>

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:57.940
<i>we may have to resort 
to less efficient means.</i>

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.920
<i>Think about it carefully.</i>

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:14.830
Last night at 7:41, there was a level C alert.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.620
The White Leviathan Dragon 
approaching Midgar

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.360
normally travels along a fixed 
route on the Pacific Ocean,

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:27.050
but this time it deviated and 
entered our security zone.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.650
Such an irregularity has occurred in the past,

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:33.700
causing a passenger boat to sink.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:37.700
<i>The Dragon incident that Iris was involved in.</i>

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:42.450
But its route this time leads straight to Midgar.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:45.740
It is expected to arrive in 
approximately thirty-three hours.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.960
It's been confirmed that 
this is the same behavior

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.200
as that exhibited two years 
ago by the Purple Kraken.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.640
Therefore,

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:56.160
any students experiencing a change in 
their Ryumon must report it immediately.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:58.620
<i>Iris?</i>

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:04.060
Even if one of you is attracting 
the Leviathan towards us,

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:07.190
we will fight without hesitation.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.590
We won't ever abandon you.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.470
<i>No...</i>

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:19.940
Where's Iris?

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.760
She's not here yet.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.320
She's seemed a bit unwell since this morning.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.530
Maybe the nurse's office?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:33.580
You're quite concerned about Iris-san.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.000
I'm just worried about her.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.040
Just like you are, Lisa.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.750
I-I'm not...

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.130
Mitsuki, I can't find Iris.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.130
Have you heard anything?

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.530
No.

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.090
I'm going to look for her.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.920
Deal with Sensei for me.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:54.600
Nii-san...

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.560
Iris?

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:23.520
Iris!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.440
Mononobe.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:27.920
Why...

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.340
That's what I want to ask you.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.850
I just wanted some time to calm down.

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:41.540
Can you show me your Ryumon?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.530
Mononobe, you pervert.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.330
Iris...

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:55.840
I know.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.550
I'm sorry.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:06.900
It keeps getting darker.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.680
I thought about jumping from 
here, but I got scared.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.180
I'm not that strong, I guess.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:19.140
No one's going to abandon you, Iris.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.580
They're going to fight with their lives.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:23.060
I'm scared.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.780
Don't you trust us?

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:30.900
But if it gets past the final defense line

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.950
and there's really no other option left...

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:36.400
I won't be able to kill myself.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.720
I'll end up a Dragon.

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:42.600
Then I'll hurt everyone.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.460
I don't want that.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.420
I really don't want that.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:47.920
Iris...

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.480
It'll be fine.

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:58.560
You won't become a Dragon. I promise.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.770
If there's really no other option left,

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.730
I'll kill you.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.680
You will?

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:11.190
Yeah, so relax and let Mitsuki 
and the others protect you.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:15.200
I won't give up until the very end.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.620
Can I really believe you?

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.660
Leave it to me.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:23.020
Actually, I'm the strongest 
assassin in the world.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.370
Or rather, I was supposed to be.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.400
What's that about?

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.300
<i>Emergency alert. Emergency alert.</i>

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.980
<i>Subject of Ryumon color change identified.</i>

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:38.200
<i>Upgrading to Alert Level A.</i>

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.810
How's Iris doing?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.280
She's been undergoing

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.820
medical evaluations and physical 
exams until just a bit ago.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:57.390
She should be terrified that 
she's attracting a Dragon,

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:00.280
but she's perfectly calm and cooperative.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.190
What should I do?

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:07.000
You won't be called as part of 
the intercept squad this time.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.730
That's perfect.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:11.210
There's something I want you to let me do.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.920
I'll protect Iris from everything 
other than the Dragon.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.560
Can you tell me more?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:21.890
NIFL said that?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.810
There's a possibility they 
might give us more trouble.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.330
If I'm there to defend Iris,

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:30.100
NIFL won't try to get involved.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:31.990
Hang on a minute.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.780
So if worst comes to worst, you'll kill Iris-san?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:36.600
Yeah.

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:41.040
But I'm going to decide when the "worst" is.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:42.600
When that happens—

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.580
Please stop!

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:48.590
I can't stand to hear that coming from you.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.290
Mitsuki...

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:53.290
I'll permit you to defend her.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:57.400
But if we can't prevent her 
from becoming a Dragon,

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.510
I'll be the one to deliver the blow.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.740
You can't!

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.330
Nii-san...

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.260
Leave it all to me.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:08.980
It's fine.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.400
My hands are already...

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.190
Mitsuki...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.360
<i>I see, so you'll take the job.</i>

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:31.290
<i>Thanks a lot.</i>

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:35.460
<i>I'm fortunate to have such excellent staff.</i>

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.750
<i>Oh, you aren't my staff anymore.</i>

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.720
So please, keep your hands out of this.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.360
Fine.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.320
I won't do anything that'll interfere with you.

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:49.180
I trust you, Lieutenant Mononobe.

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:54.680
There isn't anyone the word 
"trust" suits less than you.

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:06.830
So it's true that you're going 
to be supervising Iris-san.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.900
I'm not a supervisor, I'm a bodyguard.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:12.120
Are you here because 
you're worried about Iris?

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.580
She's a classmate. Of course I am.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.450
So you care about your friends, after all.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.360
Wh-What do you mean, "after all"?

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:24.440
We live away from our parents.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:27.280
Our classmates are like family to us.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.680
Like family, huh?

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:34.010
Just to be clear, I haven't accepted you.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.520
I don't love you like family yet.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:41.320
Well, anyway, you should 
rest up for the fight.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.990
I can't do that.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:46.450
It's our first real battle in two years.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:47.890
Real battle?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:52.910
Do you know about the Kraken 
battle from two years ago, Lisa?

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:55.870
Of course.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.320
I fought on the front lines.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:06.550
The one who defeated the pair of Krakens 
that Shinomiya-sensei talked about...

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:08.110
It wasn't...

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.010
It was Mitsuki-san.

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:15.560
I know there wasn't anything we could 
have done about it at the time.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:19.350
But emotions don't work that way.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:23.280
I can't forgive Mitsuki-san 
for having killed family.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:24.820
Family?

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:31.670
She was Brynhildr Class student 
number four, Shinomiya Miyako.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.120
Shinomiya-sensei's younger sister.

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.170
Hey.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.630
Mononobe!

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.600
The bath's over here.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:54.310
And we can see what's up 
on the island from here.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:58.410
First, can you get changed?

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.480
I'm a little embarrassed,

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.070
but I don't mind you seeing.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:07.740
It doesn't bother me.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.740
It bothers <i>me</i>!

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:14.660
Here, Mononobe, have a seat.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.640
There?

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.280
One, two...

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:27.680
H-Hey!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:30.340
Please.

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:34.970
I have another Ryumon exam coming up.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.950
Aren't you afraid to touch me?

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:38.700
Yeah.

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:43.720
But when you touched me on the rooftop,

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.640
it felt so warm.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.320
I felt safe.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:48.640
So...

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:50.470
Iris...

00:14:57.470 --> 00:14:58.750
<i>Mitsuki.</i>

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:07.380
You looked.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.420
I-It wasn't on purpose!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:17.640
Do guys like it when they see panties?

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.620
What?

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.050
Of course n—

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.690
So you do like it.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:30.820
Then... Would you like it if you saw mine?

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:31.870
Huh?

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:49.480
I don't mind showing you, 
if it'll make you happy.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:52.630
I wanted to thank you somehow.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.470
W-Wait...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:58.990
Hang on.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.840
You don't have to thank me that way.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.820
You don't want to see mine?

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:13.210
It's not about whether it's 
yours or whoever else's.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:16.200
I'm saying you shouldn't do 
that kind of thing so lightly.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:19.290
It wasn't light.

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:21.870
Then even more so.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.750
You should, y'know, 
treasure those kinds of things more.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:28.750
I wanted to thank you.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.140
Mononobe...

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:38.600
Aren't you going to protect me?

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.950
I'll be here.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:43.640
Then you should take a bath first.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.060
Why am I first?

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.480
If you use it after me,

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.900
you'll lick the bathtub and drink 
the water and stuff, won't you?

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.530
I will not!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:59.360
I'm exhausted.

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:05.360
Don't tell me...

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.240
I still want to thank you,

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:11.580
so I'm going to wash your... back...

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:21.600
You're the one who walked in!
Stop screaming!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.020
A-Aren't you going to protect me?

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.520
I'm going to sleep in the next room.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.050
I don't want to be alone.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.490
Tonight may be my last.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:41.770
Why do you want me so much?

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:45.830
You could be with Lisa or Mitsuki 
if you don't want to be alone.

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.460
Because you were nice to me.

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:54.480
Because you were nicer to me than anyone else.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:59.930
Isn't that good enough?

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:04.140
I'm not really that nice.

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:08.240
No, you're nice.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.320
You're really nice.

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.780
Thanks, Mononobe.

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.900
Don't think about dying.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:20.800
Think about what'll happen if you survive.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:24.690
But you said you'd kill me, Mononobe.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:27.390
Yeah, in the one-in-ten-thousand 
chance that it comes to that,

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:30.250
I'll kill you before you become a Dragon.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:33.710
But think about the other chances.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:36.630
The other chances?

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.170
If it's a one-in-ten-thousand chance,

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:43.400
then you still have 9,999 
more chances for a future.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:46.230
For a future in which I don't kill you.

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:48.140
You're just playing with words.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.520
Am I?

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.650
I think those are your odds.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:56.560
Besides, our classmates are working hard.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.360
Let's trust them.

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:02.170
It's weird...

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:07.330
It's convincing when you say it.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.930
Then you should get some sleep.

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:12.590
For tomorrow and all the days after.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:13.830
Okay.

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:19.800
Goodnight, Mononobe.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.510
Goodnight.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.440
Yuu-kun!

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:37.640
Yuu-kun, wait for me!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.400
Hurry up, Mitsuki.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.330
Wow.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.960
Right?

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.700
Look how small the buildings look.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.680
Where's my house?

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.090
Over there.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:58.060
I see it!

00:19:58.060 --> 00:19:59.600
What about your house?

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.230
There. Next to the shopping district.

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:07.270
I can't see it.

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:09.420
You suck, Mitsuki.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.720
I do not!

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:15.870
I kept up with you today.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.190
You're right.

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:20.150
Good for you.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.830
I finally caught up.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.480
We're going to be together 
forever from now on.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.180
Don't. It's too hot.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.290
Besides, we can't stay together forever.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.620
Of course we can.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:34.980
If we get married,

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:38.520
we can stay together even when 
we're an old grandma and grandpa.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.840
Mom said kids can't get married.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:42.890
I know.

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:46.300
So I'll settle for us being 
engaged until we grow up.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.550
Engaged?

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:52.130
Here's our engagement kiss, Yuu-kun.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:21:00.530
You will pay with your memories.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:07.450
It's here, Mononobe.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.800
It's past the first defense line.

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.260
It's coming straight this way!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.220
You love-deprived Dragon.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:41.610
You've got guts, challenging us.

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:08.960
The White Leviathan.

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.670
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:42.880
It got past our first defense line.

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:46.380
The White Leviathan has 
anti-gravity capabilities.

00:23:46.380 --> 00:23:49.350
Can we possibly escape from it?

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:52.720
If and when we can't escape,

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:54.790
please give Iris-san to me.

00:23:54.790 --> 00:23:57.740
I can't let there be a repeat 
of what happened two years ago.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.500
Give Iris-san to me, 
before she becomes a Dragon.

00:24:01.430 --> 00:24:04.250
Next time on <i>Unlimited Fafnir</i>:

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:06.000
"Howling Fafnir."

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.670
Please don't stop me anymore, Nii-san.

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:19.970
<b>Illustration: so-bin</b>
